        </div>
        <h2>Adopt this at your team.</h2>
        <p>
          We help engineering teams roll Pace out: install + connector setup, command authoring tuned to your repo's conventions, training your team on the stacked-PR loop, and ongoing support as your playbook grows.
        </p>
        <div class="fe-section-cta-row">
          <a class="cta cta-primary" href="mailto:hello@goldenberry.so?subject=Pace for engineering">Talk to us</a>
          <a class="cta cta-secondary" href="/cookbook/engineering">Read the cookbook</a>
